#. Description of the plugin
#: wp-resend-newsletter.php
msgid ""
"In-site subscriber list, campaigns, and queued email sending via Resend API "
"(resend/resend-php). Batch ≤50 recipients/request. Confirm/unsubscribe + "
"bounce/complaint webhooks. MVP: no drag-drop designer, no global wp_mail "
"replacement."
